    "trusted_professionals_HAqYth": {
      "type": "trusted-professionals",
      "blocks": {
        "card_h8d3WL": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-stephanie-spreuwers.jpg",
            "heading": "Dr. Stephanie Spreuwers",
            "text": "Functional Dentist, kPNI Practitioner",
            "hover_text": "<p>“I have been using Karmicare for a long time and feel strongly drawn to their vision of oral care. Our mouth, too, follows the natural rhythm of our body: the oral environment is different during the day than at night. What’s more, oral health does not stand on its own; it is closely connected to our general health.</p><p>As a dentist, I find the formulation interesting because of the combination of, among other things, nano-hydroxyapatite and xylitol in a fluoride-free leave-on formula. Because you don’t need to rinse after brushing, the caring ingredients stay in contact with the teeth and the mouth for longer. The two different formulas also fit nicely within the vision of our natural day-and-night rhythm: fresh and invigorating in the morning (with guarana for morning energy), and warmer and spicier in the evening (with valerian, which contributes to calm and relaxation).</p><p>My patients who use Karmicare are very happy with it and find it a pleasant toothpaste. My children, who are critical about flavours, also use Karmicare with pleasure! I find that at least as important: good oral care starts with a toothpaste you enjoy and keep using consistently. Wonderfully fresh, without feeling aggressive in the mouth. I’m a fan!”</p>"
          }
        },
        "card_jcnr7Q": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-mariama-seco-banjai.jpg",
            "heading": "Mariama Banjai",
            "text": "Dental Hygienist, Oral Care Quality Manager",
            "hover_text": "<p>“As a dental hygienist and quality manager with more than 13 years of experience in oral healthcare, I am critical about which products I recommend. What I particularly value about Karmicare is the combination of an effective and safe formulation that is also pleasant to use.</p><p>In my own experience I notice a pleasant taste, a smoother feel on the teeth and teeth that look whiter, and all that without fluoride. It offers an interesting and reliable alternative for both professional and everyday use.</p><p>I see Karmicare as a valuable addition to modern oral care and see good potential for use by a broad audience.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "card_8dRing": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-leen-ponet.jpg",
            "heading": "Leen Ponet",
            "text": "Pharmacist, Orthomolecular Practitioner, kPNI Coordinator",
            "hover_text": "<p>“Karmicare offers fluoride-free oral care in a thoughtful way, with hydroxyapatite as a scientifically supported choice. By also taking biorhythm into account, the brand touches on the foundations on which true health is built. This vision aligns seamlessly with my professional conviction that only an integrated approach, bringing together science, biology, rhythm and nature, leads to lasting health.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "card_HFdkaD": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-iveta-plesa-rutule.jpg",
            "heading": "Dr. Iveta Pleša Rutule",
            "text": "Holistic Dentist",
            "hover_text": ""
          }
        },
        "card_Ah46TM": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr._Kris_Sienaert.png",
            "heading": "Dr. Kris Sienaert",
            "text": "Former GP, Lifestyle Medicine",
            "hover_text": ""
          }
        },
        "card_CtQgU9": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-sietske-hamelink.jpg",
            "heading": "Sietske Hamelink",
            "text": "Nutritional Practitioner, Menstrual Cycle Expert",
            "hover_text": "<p>“As a nutritional therapist specialized in female hormones, I’m extremely careful about what I put into my body. Hormones are sensitive. Stress, toxins, poor-quality ingredients — they all add up. So I don’t just look at labels, I look at what something will do inside the body.</p><p>I choose Karmicare because I trust what’s in it — and what’s not. No unnecessary fillers, no hidden disruptors. Just clean, purposeful ingredients that support rather than burden the nervous system and hormonal balance. When you understand how delicate the female endocrine system can be, especially under chronic stress, quality isn’t optional.</p><p>And that’s also why I use it in my practice.</p><p>I work with women dealing with PMS, cycle issues, stress-related fatigue, estrogen dominance and adrenal dysregulation. I need products that are technically sound — bioavailable, well-formulated, and supportive of detox pathways and nervous system regulation.</p><p>Karmicare fits that standard.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "card_qAPajg": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-kim-verlot.png",
            "heading": "Kim Verlot",
            "text": "Breathing Coach, Heart Coherence Specialist",
            "hover_text": "<p>“Supporting my biorhythm is important to me. Brushing my teeth with Karmicare fits into my daily ritual to help my nervous system transition between day and night. I also find that it helps me enormously to keep my receding gums under control.”</p>"
          }
        }
      },
